## Rules
- A ticket can touch several repos: same branch name everywhere, one PR per repo, PRs linked to each other.
- Order of work and merge: the `order` in workspace.yml (producer before consumer).
- Each repo keeps its own commands (`<repo>/.agentic/pipeline.yml`) and its own `CLAUDE.md`; read the repo's one before coding in it.
- Before creating a branch in a repo, check that it has no uncommitted work in progress.
- No secrets in the repos or in this folder.
